> I was on hand to join Secretary Kennedy in promoting healthier eating habits and raising awareness about the importance of eating real, nutritious food for families across Pennsylvania. Growing up on a farm, I learned firsthand the value of fresh, wholesome food. This initiative reminds us that healthy eating starts with real ingredients, and I’m proud to support efforts that make nutritious choices accessible for families across Pennsylvania.

